    {
      "sectionId": "section-introduction",
      "heading": "Introduction",
      "sourceAnchor": "introduction",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-introduction-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "strong",
              "text": "NOTE:"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " This article has not yet been updated to reflect the 2024 rules. We’re waiting to see the Monster Manual before we can accurately assess the state of the meta."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-introduction-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As new source materials are released and those materials are explored, the state the character optimization “meta” changes over time. A basic understanding of the state of the meta will help you a great deal in understanding character optimization and articles written about character optimization, including my own."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-introduction-3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This article describes the 2014 DnD 5e rules. For the 2024 rules, see our article on the 2024 meta."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
